---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout pageTitle="Welcome">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-8">
      <h1>Welcome</h1>
      <div class="alert alert-success">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0">Read Game Wrap online!</h3>
        <p>
          All volumes of Game Wrap are available for free online reading, free
          download as PDF, and for purchase in hardcopy.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-inline" style="margin-top: 1em">
          <li class="list-inline-item">
            <a href="/vol1" class="btn btn-primary">Volume 1</a>
          </li>
          <li class="list-inline-item">
            <a href="/vol2" class="btn btn-primary">Volume 2</a>
          </li>
          <li class="list-inline-item">
            <a href="/vol3" class="btn btn-primary">Volume 3</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p>
        Game Wrap is a yearly publication focusing on the art and craft of live
        action roleplaying games. We hope to allow for a more fluid exchange of
        ideas and experience, and wider opportunities for learning from each
        other.
      </p>

      <p>
        Game Wrap is released online in HTML and PDF formats as well as in hard
        copy on demand. We publish articles about larp theory and practice - the
        process of writing and running games as well as playing in them. We also
        publish analyses of larp as an art form, educational or therapeutic
        tool, and recreation. We will include one or two full texts of larps in
        each issue, accompanied by the author’s reflective essay. All forms and
        traditions of larp are welcome.
      </p>
      <h3>Now accepting submissions and ideas!</h3>
      <p>
        Game Wrap is now accepting submissions of articles and larps for Volume
        4!
        <a href="/submissions">You can submit your article or larp here.</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        If you’re not quite ready to submit a proposal, but have an idea for an
        article that you’d like to run past us, you can <a href="/ideas"
          >send us an idea and we can help you turn it into a proposal.</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div
        id="mc_embed_signup"
        class="panel panel-default"
        style="margin-top: 2em"
      >
        <div class="panel-body">
          <form
            id="mc-embedded-subscribe-form"
            class="validate form"
            action="//interconlarp.us1.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=5e60a19a38b901e64d8066279&id=d186505bb6"
            method="post"
            name="mc-embedded-subscribe-form"
            target="_blank"
            novalidate
          >
            <div id="mc_embed_signup_scroll"></div>
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0">Subscribe to our mailing list!</h4>
            <p>
              If you'd like to be notified about upcoming issues and other news
              from Game Wrap, please subscribe to our mailing list by filling
              out the form below.
            </p>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-sm-6">
                <div class="mc-field-group form-group">
                  <label for="mce-FNAME">First Name</label>
                  <input
                    id="mce-FNAME"
                    class="form-control"
                    type="text"
                    value=""
                    name="FNAME"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-6">
                <div class="mc-field-group form-group">
                  <label for="mce-LNAME">Last Name</label>
                  <input
                    id="mce-LNAME"
                    class="form-control"
                    type="text"
                    value=""
                    name="LNAME"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mc-field-group form-group">
              <label for="mce-EMAIL">Email Address</label>
              <input
                id="mce-EMAIL"
                class="form-control required email"
                type="email"
                value=""
                name="EMAIL"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="clear" id="mce-responses">
              <div
                id="mce-error-response"
                class="response alert-danger"
                style="display: none"
              >
              </div>
              <div
                id="mce-success-response"
                class="response alert-success"
                style="display: none"
              >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: absolute; left: -5000px">
              <input
                type="text"
                name="b_5e60a19a38b901e64d8066279_d186505bb6"
                tabindex="-1"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
            <div class="clear">
              <input
                id="mc-embedded-subscribe"
                class="button btn btn-primary"
                type="submit"
                value="Subscribe"
                name="subscribe"
              />
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <hr />
  Game Wrap is a publication of
  <a href="http://www.interactiveliterature.org"
    >New England Interactive Literature</a
  >.
</MainLayout>
